acceptance_criteria: "Persist a unique compensation_id and complete immutable member/preimage/history-head domain before any restore; fsync journal checkpoints and parent-directory updates; bind every native restore to that compensation identity and exact target; durably checkpoint restored members; recover without classifying own progress as a peer; preserve peer edits and report typed restored/pending lists; real-process SIGKILL after each restore 0..N with 1-3 dependents converges to exact pre-close item bytes while retaining audit history; peer edit between restores and copied marker tests preserve foreign mutations; packed npm and Bun consumers, docs, focused revert proofs and full CI gates."
